    // ================================================================ ATTACK ON TITAN — titan shifting
    // Bite your hand: a lightning strike blasts everyone near you away and you STAND UP as a titan you
    // pilot (the giants/piloting systems: nape weak point, limbs, rideable). Eject = you tear out of
    // the nape. Each of the Nine is its own body: the Attack Titan brawls, the Armored charges through
    // anything, the Colossal is a walking steam bomb, the Female is fast and hardens her strikes, the
    // Beast throws boulders, the War Hammer grows spikes, the Jaw bites, the Cart carries cannons.
    // (The bare titan names stay the SUMMONS in the icon pack — these are the shifter phrases.)
    (
        id: "attack_titan",
        name: "Attack Titan Shifting",
        kind: Technique,
        names: ["titan shifting", "titan shift", "titan shifter", "attack titan shift", "shift into the attack titan", "become a titan",
                "turn into a titan", "titan transformation", "become the attack titan", "attack titan shifting", "eren's power",
                "power of the titans", "shingeki no kyojin"],
        ascend: Some((color: Some((1.0, 0.92, 0.45)), intensity: 1.8, title: Some("ATTACK TITAN"), eye_glow: Some((0.4, 1.0, 0.6)))),
