    // ================================================================ FULLMETAL ALCHEMIST — alchemy
    // Clap, touch the ground: the ground itself becomes what you need. Each alchemist is a tier: the
    // Fullmetal raises walls, spikes and cannons out of the terrain, the Flame snaps sparks into
    // explosions where you look, the Strong Arm punches stone into missiles, the Crimson detonates.
    (
        id: "alchemy",
        name: "Alchemy",
