    // ---------------------------------------------------------------- Aoi Todo: Boogie Woogie
    // CLAP: you and whatever you're looking at trade places — an enemy, a friend, a thrown boulder,
    // someone's summon. Clap again, and again: every clap is a swap (cooldown 0.35 s), so the
    // chain "clap -> clap -> black flash" is the whole character. The Shuffle swaps two OTHER things:
    // the one you're looking at and the one you last hit. A clap is a connect: a Black Flash thrown
    // right after one lands inside its window.
    (
        id: "todo_kit",
        name: "Aoi Todo",
        kind: Kit,
        names: ["todo", "aoi todo", "todo aoi", "toudou", "todo's", "toe dough", "todou"],
        fx: "cursed",
